<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>About Us | Blockchain Track</title>
    <style>
      @import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap");

      :root {
        --ink: #0f1a2b;
        --muted: #5c6773;
        --surface: #ffffff;
        --pearl: #f6f7fb;
        --brand: #2554ff;
        --brand-dark: #1c2f88;
        --accent: #0ecb81;
        --sun: #ffb350;
        --plum: #5428a1;
        --radius-lg: 24px;
        --radius-md: 16px;
        --shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(15, 26, 43, 0.12);
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: "Space Grotesk", "Segoe UI", Tahoma, sans-serif;
        color: var(--ink);
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #eef2ff 0%, #ffffff 55%, #f0f4ff 100%);
        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .page {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 72px;
      }

      .nav {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 10;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e9f2;
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      }

      .nav-inner {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 18px 20px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .logo {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .logo-mark {
        width: 38px;
        height: 38px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), #6d7bff);
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 18px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(37, 84, 255, 0.25);
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 18px;
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .nav-links a {
        padding: 6px 8px;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }

      .nav-links a.active {
        background: #eef2ff;
        color: var(--brand-dark);
      }

      .wallet-tag {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #0a7a4a;
        background: #e8fbf1;
        padding: 6px 10px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid #c6f1dc;
      }

      .hero {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        padding: 88px 20px 110px;
        background: linear-gradient(140deg, #1a2a7a 0%, #2648ff 45%, #4b64ff 100%);
        color: #fff;
      }

      .hero::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        width: 420px;
        height: 420px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 179, 80, 0.35), rgba(255, 179, 80, 0));
        top: -140px;
        right: -100px;
      }

      .hero::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        width: 520px;
        height: 520px;
        border-radius: 40%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(14, 203, 129, 0.3), rgba(14, 203, 129, 0));
        bottom: -280px;
        left: -160px;
      }

      .hero-inner {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        display: grid;
        gap: 28px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
        font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.8rem);
        margin: 0;
        max-width: 620px;
      }

      .hero p {
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        max-width: 640px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      }

      .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 16px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .pill {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        font-size: 13px;
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      }

      .cta {
        padding: 12px 22px;
        background: #fff;
        color: #1a2a7a;
        font-weight: 600;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
        box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      }

      .section {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 20px;
      }

      .section h2 {
        font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
        font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
        margin: 0 0 12px;
      }

      .section p.lead {
        margin: 0;
        max-width: 700px;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .grid {
        margin-top: 32px;
        display: grid;
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .grid.cols-3 {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      }

      .grid.cols-2 {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      }

      .card {
        background: var(--surface);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        padding: 22px;
        border: 1px solid #e7eaf3;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .card.small {
        box-shadow: none;
        background: var(--pearl);
      }

      .card h3 {
        margin: 12px 0 8px;
        font-size: 18px;
      }

      .card p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .icon {
        width: 44px;
        height: 44px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #fff;
      }

      .icon.blue {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2b5cff, #1a2a7a);
      }

      .icon.green {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #19d48f, #0b8f5f);
      }

      .icon.sun {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffb14c, #f0713c);
      }

      .icon.plum {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6d46ff, #5428a1);
      }

      .steps {
        display: grid;
        gap: 18px;
        margin-top: 26px;
      }

      .step {
        padding: 18px 20px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #e7eaf3;
        display: grid;
        gap: 6px;
      }

      .step span {
        font-size: 12px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        color: #8a93a0;
      }

      .split {
        display: grid;
        gap: 24px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .split.media {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      }

      .stats {
        display: grid;
        gap: 18px;
        margin-top: 22px;
      }

      .stat {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #e7eaf3;
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 18px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .stat h4 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 22px;
        color: var(--brand);
      }

      .stat p {
        margin: 6px 0 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .team {
        display: grid;
        gap: 16px;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      }

      .member {
        padding: 18px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        border: 1px solid #e7eaf3;
        background: #fff;
      }

      .member .badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        font-size: 12px;
        padding: 4px 10px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: #f1f4ff;
        color: var(--brand-dark);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .member h4 {
        margin: 0 0 6px;
      }

      .member p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .footer {
        padding: 34px 20px 48px;
        background: #0f1a2b;
        color: #cfd6e4;
      }

      .footer-inner {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .footer a {
        color: #cfd6e4;
      }

      .reveal {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(14px);
        animation: rise 0.8s ease forwards;
        animation-delay: var(--d, 0s);
      }

      @keyframes rise {
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: translateY(0);
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 720px) {
        .nav-links {
          display: none;
        }

        .hero {
          padding: 76px 18px 90px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page">
      <nav class="nav">
        <div class="nav-inner">
          <a class="logo" href="/">
            <span class="logo-mark">BT</span>
            Blockchain Track
          </a>
          <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="/">Marketplace</a>
            <a class="active" href="/about">About Us</a>
          </div>
          <div class="wallet-tag">
            Blockchain Secured
          </div>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <header class="hero">
        <div class="hero-inner">
          <div class="pill reveal" style="--d: 0.05s;">Built for verified commerce</div>
          <h1 class="reveal" style="--d: 0.1s;">We make every transaction provable, transparent, and fair.</h1>
          <p class="reveal" style="--d: 0.2s;">
            Blockchain Track is a Singapore-based marketplace focused on authentic listings, tamper-proof delivery
            trails, and automated dispute resolution. We build the trust layer between buyers and sellers.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions reveal" style="--d: 0.3s;">
            <a class="cta" href="/">Explore Marketplace</a>
            <div class="pill">Founded 2023</div>
            <% if (acct) { %>
              <div class="pill">Wallet: <%= acct %></div>
            <% } %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="section">
        <h2 class="reveal" style="--d: 0.05s;">Our mission</h2>
        <p class="lead reveal" style="--d: 0.1s;">
          We help fast-growing commerce teams ship with confidence by pairing blockchain provenance with modern
          marketplace UX. The result is faster trust, fewer disputes, and verifiable product histories.
        </p>
        <div class="grid cols-3">
          <div class="card reveal" style="--d: 0.15s;">
            <div class="icon blue">01</div>
            <h3>End-to-end traceability</h3>
            <p>Every listing, shipment, and delivery update is anchored to a verifiable ledger.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="--d: 0.2s;">
            <div class="icon green">02</div>
            <h3>Automated safeguards</h3>
            <p>Smart contracts hold funds in escrow and release only after confirmed delivery.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="--d: 0.25s;">
            <div class="icon sun">03</div>
            <h3>Trust signals buyers see</h3>
            <p>Verified seller reputation, immutable reviews, and proof of authenticity.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="split media">
          <div class="reveal" style="--d: 0.05s;">
            <h2>How we build trust</h2>
            <p class="lead">
              We unite smart contracts, verified identities, and logistics proof to reduce chargebacks and speed
              up settlements.
            </p>
            <div class="steps">
              <div class="step">
                <span>Step 01</span>
                <strong>Verify sellers and listings</strong>
                <p>Onboarded merchants are screened and tied to on-chain IDs.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="step">
                <span>Step 02</span>
                <strong>Record every event</strong>
                <p>Orders, shipping scans, and delivery confirmations are signed and stored.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="step">
                <span>Step 03</span>
                <strong>Resolve disputes fast</strong>
                <p>Immutable data makes chargeback investigations quick and fair.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card small reveal" style="--d: 0.1s;">
            <h3>Why it matters</h3>
            <p>
              Traditional marketplaces rely on centralized records. Blockchain Track distributes trust so buyers,
              sellers, and regulators can verify independently.
            </p>
            <div class="grid cols-2">
              <div class="card">
                <div class="icon plum">A</div>
                <h3>Audit-ready</h3>
                <p>Every transaction has a signed trail.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="card">
                <div class="icon sun">B</div>
                <h3>Fewer disputes</h3>
                <p>Immutable proofs reduce fraud and chargebacks.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="card">
                <div class="icon green">C</div>
                <h3>Faster payouts</h3>
                <p>Instant releases after verified delivery.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="card">
                <div class="icon blue">D</div>
                <h3>Buyer confidence</h3>
                <p>Customers can validate origin and handling.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2 class="reveal" style="--d: 0.05s;">Our team</h2>
        <p class="lead reveal" style="--d: 0.1s;">
          A multidisciplinary crew blending blockchain engineering, logistics ops, and marketplace design.
        </p>
        <div class="team">
          <div class="member reveal" style="--d: 0.15s;">
            <div class="badge">Product</div>
            <h4>Market Strategy</h4>
            <p>Defines go-to-market focus for verified commerce across SEA.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="member reveal" style="--d: 0.2s;">
            <div class="badge">Engineering</div>
            <h4>Smart Contract Ops</h4>
            <p>Builds escrow logic, reputation proofs, and audit trails.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="member reveal" style="--d: 0.25s;">
            <div class="badge">Trust</div>
            <h4>Risk & Compliance</h4>
            <p>Ensures dispute workflows are fair, fast, and transparent.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="member reveal" style="--d: 0.3s;">
            <div class="badge">Design</div>
            <h4>Marketplace UX</h4>
            <p>Crafts buyer journeys that surface proof without friction.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="card reveal" style="--d: 0.1s;">
          <div class="split media">
            <div>
              <h2>Based in Singapore</h2>
              <p class="lead">
                Our team collaborates with regional partners to strengthen authenticity, traceability, and
                commerce resilience across Southeast Asia.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="stats">
              <div class="stat">
                <h4>2023</h4>
                <p>Founded</p>
              </div>
              <div class="stat">
                <h4>5,000+</h4>
                <p>Verified Sellers</p>
              </div>
              <div class="stat">
                <h4>50,000+</h4>
                <p>On-chain Transactions</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer-inner">
          <strong>Blockchain Track</strong>
          <span>Singapore, SG 049419</span>
          <span>hello@blockchaintrack.sg</span>
          <span>+65 6123 4567</span>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
